  "name": "luh-cad-data-and-simulation-results-for-a-study-on-thermal-management-in-multi-material-microreactor",
  "notes": "# Description\r\nThis data set contains the CAD files of 12 different multi-material microchannel reactors for ammonia decomposition. The designs are intended for additive manufacturing on an Aconity MIDI+ equipped with an Aerosint Selective Powder Deposition Recoater V1.0 (or similar machines). The CAD data is available in manufacturer-neutral .step file format.\r\nCFD simulations were performed in Ansys Fluent using these designs. The raw data from these simulations are included in this data set in neutral .csv format.\r\n\r\n#References\r\nThe research data was used in the following publication:\r\nhttps://doi.org/10.1017/pds.2026.10559\r\n\r\n# Acknowledgements\r\nThis work is part of the project “Additive Fertigung multimaterieller Komponenten zur nachhaltigen Energiewandlung”, which was funded by the European Regional Development Fund (ERDF) and the state of Lower Saxony – Project number ZW 7–87011865.",
